  "wrong_measurement_note": "Fresh direct boots from the tester ISO kernel and Surfbird; each guest received one deliberately incorrect hex digit in its expected kernel digest. The three full desktop sizes stated that programs were disabled. At 320x200 and 640x480 the small launcher omitted the explicit notice before Enter. At 320x200 the refusal explanation after Enter ended in \u201cand sta..\u201d. All five refused the launch and the displayed register count stayed at six before the two shutdown records.",
